flowchart TD
A([User presses Generate]) --> B{courses and classrooms loaded?}
B -- no --> B1[Show error] --> Z([End])
B -- yes --> C[quickInfeasibility: exams per student, clique of shared-student courses]
C -- impossible --> N[Result: no schedule + reason + minimum days] --> M
C -- possible --> D[Backtracking: pick unplaced course with fewest feasible positions]
D --> E[Try each day/slot: not same or consecutive slot as a course sharing students, max 2 exams per student per day]
E --> F[Assign classroom: capacity at least course size, one exam per room per slot]
F --> G{all courses placed?}
G -- no --> D
G -- dead end --> H[Backtrack]
H --> D
G -- yes --> I[ConstraintChecker.check independent verification]
I -- violations --> X[Reject: internal error]
I -- ok --> S[Show Schedule, enable Views]
D -- time limit 20 s --> T[Result: no schedule found in time, try more days] --> M
N --> M[Show message to user; data unchanged]
